For the uncapped rule schema, take $`n\ge2`$, the distinct forward/reverse XOR
folds, no hard or soft rows, rank cutoff zero, and difference bound zero.
The difference is identically zero. On every proper Boolean box the inherited
collector keeps the two nonlinear features distinct and returns upper bound
