current-row multipliers: those rows concern assigned coordinates and cannot
cancel the two nonlinear features. The proof requires exactly

```math
2^n\text{ leaves},\qquad 2^{n+1}-1\text{ visited tree nodes}.
```

These are unfolded/visited nodes and the corresponding nested tree format,
